{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/02da96cfb614439263bfad34d40802d6.avif?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/07c5b4fbb03552d3d2d2925b88d82a54.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/20572840486baa47f4bd38fc81a1921a.poster.avif?t=1746475862\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/20572840486baa47f4bd38fc81a1921a.webm?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/20572840486baa47f4bd38fc81a1921a.mp4?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/c14bd65e059dfbd88eacafbf302b5a3e.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span>Jump into <strong>Genopanic</strong>, a wild (NOT)metroidvania ride! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a plasma cutter, boot up virtual doggo LAIK, outsmart sly cat-girl AI VOLGA - the station's troublemaker, unravel the Dark Matter enigma, and explore DNA experiments in a cosmic adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/f546d34c94d2a558d1f40a4542c94839.avif?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/07c5b4fbb03552d3d2d2925b88d82a54.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/a8307ee80737f9044419009ecd006dd8.poster.avif?t=1746475862\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/a8307ee80737f9044419009ecd006dd8.webm?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/a8307ee80737f9044419009ecd006dd8.mp4?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/c14bd65e059dfbd88eacafbf302b5a3e.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span>Meet the adorably terrifying GMO critters that you'll definitely want in your collection! We don't know what they were fed in the lab, but they won't leave you indifferent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/67560ed55f18391417fe31aa0645b9c2.avif?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/07c5b4fbb03552d3d2d2925b88d82a54.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/fceebd580a012dd781c21d102c691cba.poster.avif?t=1746475862\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/fceebd580a012dd781c21d102c691cba.webm?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/fceebd580a012dd781c21d102c691cba.mp4?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/c14bd65e059dfbd88eacafbf302b5a3e.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span>Do you prefer flamethrowers or plasma cutters? Or maybe grav-guns tickle your fancy? Whatever you choose, we're confident you'll find the right weapon to defeat any mutant on your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/1bb86b1c7c835938e49d41f1264e8372.avif?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/07c5b4fbb03552d3d2d2925b88d82a54.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/8c02ecf45203fb9edb23d816d670d36b.poster.avif?t=1746475862\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/8c02ecf45203fb9edb23d816d670d36b.webm?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/8c02ecf45203fb9edb23d816d670d36b.mp4?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/c14bd65e059dfbd88eacafbf302b5a3e.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span>From ridiculously silly zombies to fat, angry green mutants, meaty flying bees, crawling crab-walkers, and the Female Combat Cleanup Squad with their robot destroyers - all are your future foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/df09f98b64076c22ddefd53238df7987.avif?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/07c5b4fbb03552d3d2d2925b88d82a54.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/f704768b6103bc09308f848f12e60f2d.poster.avif?t=1746475862\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/f704768b6103bc09308f848f12e60f2d.webm?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/f704768b6103bc09308f848f12e60f2d.mp4?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/c14bd65e059dfbd88eacafbf302b5a3e.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span>LAIK - a virtual doggo and VOLGA - a mischievous cat-girl and the station's AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both are so adorable you'll want to squeeze them... if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings await. What journey do you want - a challenging, mysterious one or a fun, carefree romp? Decide which secrets are worth uncovering, but remember: the ending of the game depends on your decision\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/07c5b4fbb03552d3d2d2925b88d82a54.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/f7607f99402d3c7a025f76fa32ac08fa.poster.avif?t=1746475862\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/f7607f99402d3c7a025f76fa32ac08fa.webm?t=1746475862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/extras/c14bd65e059dfbd88eacafbf302b5a3e.webp?t=1746475862\" width=618 height=18 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> - Explore the abandoned space station with atmospheric levels and unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong> - Use an arsenal of weapons - a sword, gun, flamethrower and more - to defeat aggressive creatures in the most effective ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternate endings</strong> - The game has a non-linear story with several plot branches. The ending of the story depends on your actions and decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music </strong>- The atmospheric soundtrack and manually produced sound effects convey the unique atmosphere of the game and immerse you in a real space adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome Aboard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/bce2c66b7cada34ab92a85cfcf566628241d3cf5.jpg"},{"name":"Data Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/ac3b8b8f562db2dd09e44d072dca3e3a10cb326b.jpg"},{"name":"Elementary!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/4a756245a5c4b4d80a9e6dc9c9ec889f014cc152.jpg"},{"name":"First Contact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/7185286b2f5a7925046e0416f6d21dd90324fb69.jpg"},{"name":"Dark story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/82c066efd0e2788a4b4fc804ee6ea86611d0055c.jpg"},{"name":"Armed and Dangerous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/9e7ba684cd811f93c3f91c8c16d329431fe301ad.jpg"},{"name":"What's This GMO?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/271b3c6bd2ae959b05ec457387cf8f581e887b9a.jpg"},{"name":"Ad Astra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/05a2026763b05c9b6961f9c29e20656581f7c590.jpg"},{"name":"Take care!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/9f0175555ec96b8527265ddf95fdc205dc5d3294.jpg"},{"name":"Troublemaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1984190/dfbc8f17213566e48972d41811037499b729ad7f.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1984190?t=1746475862","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746475862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/c30c7414ed6d7ec46c30130f50bfbdba6cd9bffe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746475862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984190/c30c7414ed6d7ec46c30130f50bfbdba6cd9bffe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746475862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":